# Zipper split batch 13 (2026-10-05, session genealogy-fa): the careful pass on the UNSURE pairs (#46, 53, 90, 348, 349, 386, 491, 519, 560, 693, 702, 812, 840, 901, 910).
# Different given names in one slot are two people (CLAUDE.md, 2026-10-04): the zipper links come off and the Geni person is created. Cleves: Theodorich = Dietrich, so #348 is one man with a disputed father (Dietrich II on Wikidata, Konrad on Geni, created); #349 Konrad is not Dietrich II.
# #53: the Wikidata NN is the mother of Marketta Perttulintytar (d. 1676), not Margareta Bertilsdotter Mjohund (c. 1550-1615). Kept: #114 (Aribo and Hartwig are brothers; Friderun is Aribo's mother), #444 (same name 藤原頼成). Run with Run, never in background.
